{"id":72683,"name":"Mária-út, M03-19 (Pécs – Máriakéménd)","category":"hike","country":"HU","generated_at":"2026-08-13T14:18:47+00:00","description_md":"The Mária-út M03-19 is a waymarked hiking route in HU that connects Pécs and Máriakéménd. This trail covers a distance of 27.2 km and is classified as hard due to the distance and ascent.\n\nThe route is signposted as M03/19 and is part of an international waymarked hiking network. It includes 278 m of ascent and 299 m of descent. The walking time is about 7.5 hours on the DIN 33466 hiking time rule. The path passes the National Theatre of Pécs within 100 m, the Episcopal Palace within 100 m, and the Barbakán within 200 m.","distance_m":27175,"ascent_m":278,"descent_m":299,"duration_min":453,"difficulty":"hard","sac_scale":null,"network":"iwn","bbox":[18.223624,46.015562,18.462972,46.077684],"geometry":{"type":"MultiLineString","coordinates":[[[18.223624,46.077572,158.6],[18.223758,46.077579,159],[18.223896,46.077585,159.5],[18.225146,46.077655,161],[18.225159,46.077655,161],[18.225162,46.077655,161],[18.225231,46.077657,161.4],[18.225261,46.077658,161.6],[18.225299,46.077659,161.9],[18.225515,46.077648,163.6],[18.225659,46.07763,164.3],[18.225706,46.077602,164.5],[18.225759,46.07757,164.8],[18.225817,46.07757,165],[18.225916,46.077566,165.4],[18.226054,46.077553,165.9],[18.226309,46.077532,166.7],[18.226648,46.077459,166],[18.227181,46.077336,165.8],[18.227352,46.077296,164],[18.227396,46.077288,163.5],[18.227533,46.077264,163],[18.227648,46.07669,158.6],[18.227704,46.07641,154.9],[18.227738,46.076253,154.3],[18.227787,46.076161,154],[18.227868,46.076115,153.8],[18.228028,46.076076,154.3],[18.228218,46.07607,156.6],[18.228228,46.076045,157],[18.228422,46.076082,158.9],[18.228593,46.076115,160],[18.228899,46.076168,160.9],[18.229021,46.076189,161],[18.229778,46.076345,157.3],[18.230276,46.076477,158.4],[18.230836,46.076594,156.5],[18.231733,46.076738,158.2],[18.231987,46.076776,154.6],[18.232312,46.076824,154.5],[18